GFX.Font distributes target-specific static artifacts built from FreeType and
HarfBuzz. It also distributes Noto Sans and Noto Sans Mono assets and test
fixtures derived from those fonts, plus a Source Code Pro CFF test fixture.
The FreeType Project License, HarfBuzz license, Noto SIL Open Font License, and
Source Code Pro SIL Open Font License are kept in the Licenses directory.
